        {
          "left": "40.0px",
          "top": "442.0px",
          "width": "714.0px",
          "height": "115.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif; border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom:12px;'><div style='font-family:Georgia, serif; font-size:26px; font-weight:900; color:#581c87; line-height:1.15; margin-bottom:8px;'>EMBRACING AUTUMN: GROUNDING PRACTICES FOR VATA SEASON</div><div style='font-size:13.5px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; font-weight:500;'>As cooler winds arrive, explore warming pranayama breathwork, sesame oil abhyanga self-care rituals, and our upcoming 200-Hour Yoga Teacher Training cohort.</div></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 3,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
        },
        {
          "left": "40.0px",
          "top": "575.0px",
          "width": "455.0px",
          "height": "375.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:Georgia, serif; font-size:12.8px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.7;'><p style='margin-top:0; margin-bottom:14px;'>Over the past six months, our community has witnessed an extraordinary wave of collaboration, craftsmanship, and forward-looking initiative. What began as a series of small working groups has blossomed into a flagship program setting new benchmarks across the region.</p><div style='background:#f8fafc; border-left:4px solid #14b8a6; padding:12px 16px; margin:14px 0; font-style:italic; font-weight:700; color:#581c87; font-size:13.5px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'>“When passionate people combine clear vision with disciplined execution, extraordinary outcomes follow naturally.”</div><p style='margin-bottom:0;'>Looking ahead to the winter schedule, we are introducing expanded hands-on workshops, mentorship pairings, and member-led symposia. Full registration details and resource kits are now live on the member portal.</p></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 4,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
        },
        {
          "left": "515.0px",
          "top": "575.0px",
          "width": "239.0px",
